# severity: high; images: agent-aider, agent-gemini
# tarfile.extractall() with 'data'/'tar' filter can be bypassed. Python 3.11
# installed in agent-gemini for tooling compatibility; tarfile is not invoked on
# attacker-controlled archives by any container workload at runtime.
