# release cycle (BL398 Phase 1's live rescan baseline).
CVE-2026-11940

# libglib2.0-0 -- CVE-2026-58016, CVE-2026-58010, CVE-2026-58011, CVE-2026-58012, CVE-2026-58013, CVE-2026-58014, CVE-2026-58015
# severity: critical/high; images: parent-full
