# GIO path, D-Bus auth). signal-cli connects only to operator-configured Signal
# servers; no untrusted GLib input at runtime. CVE-2026-58016: integer underflow
# in gdbusintrospection.c; remaining 6 are buffer/path issues across
# giochannel.c, gvariant-serialiser.c, g_regex_replace(), gkeyfile.c,
# gdbusauthmechanismsha1.c.
