# libgssapi-krb5-2, libk5crypto3, libkrb5-3, libkrb5support0 -- CVE-2026-119079
# severity: high; images: agent-base
# CVE-2026-119079 is in an ASN.1 sequence decoder in the client library. It is
# reachable only when git, ssh or curl performs Kerberos or GSSAPI
# authentication against a Kerberos realm. The agent images configure no
# Kerberos client, no keytab and no realm, and run no GSSAPI-authenticated
# service, so the code path is not exercised.
